hello and welcome to the new order of  your source for everything anime and  manga and more specifically welcome to  the encyclopedia where today we are  going to be tackling the rather  insurmountable topic  of one isaac netara a very difficult  character to examine when it comes  purely to nenu's because he stands so  far and above almost any other that  we've seen in the series usually these  encyclopedia videos are based on  examining how characters have rather  creatively structured and crafted  abilities based on their limitations the  problem in this case being that word  limitations because for all intents and  purposes netro doesn't really  have those in fact he was even  recognized by the ant king marowam as a  rare example of one that had transcended  human limitations through sheer effort  alone but the thing that impressed  meruem most was netro's mastery of  pressing the subscribe button for the  new world review thus allowing him to  receive regular hunt on content uploaded  straight into his youtube feed so please  do feel free to transcend your own  limits by pressing this delightful red  button as well but netero and nen really  cannot be explained as simply as many  other characters more so than any other  netro harbors a deep connection with his  aura one that was forged through a task  that drove him to the brink of madness  at the age of 46 netro enamored and  grateful to the very concept of martial  arts decided to dedicate his life to  giving thanks and he would do this by  offering 10  000 punches every day before collapsing  in exhaustion to rest briefly and then  rinse and repeat this worship  this process took netro 18 hours to  complete on his first day's worth of  bunches however after performing the  ritual for two years straight netro was  able to complete it before the sun had  even set and then another two years  after that netro was capable of offering  10 000 punches in less than an hour  having surpassed all preconceived bounds  of human physicality however he did not  neglect his mind either because as the  time to perform the ritual decrease  netro devoted more and more time to  prayer and he proceeded to do this for  an unknown quantity of time before  finally returning back to civilization  as one of the greatest and most  terrifying nun masters that this world  has ever known and i suppose what's  important to note about nen at this  early stage is that aura manipulation  occurs as a direct response to emotion  drive and desire  and you will rarely meet a character in  hunt hunter who is more driven than  isaac netro someone who is willing to  dedicate years and years of his life to  such a seemingly simplistic action and  from there the aura response is dictated  by aura quantity and if you possess a  rather large amount like natural then  this is going  to result in a truly profound ability or  even set of abilities  and now before we even go into netro's  golden funky statue we should note that  he is not only a master but quite  possibly the undisputed master of the  basic principles of nen such as 10  renzetsu and hatsu  as well as the many advanced  applications such as ko shu in kanryu  whatever it doesn't matter if it's  non-related netro is well versed in it  and we know this because whilst we have  not seen netro display many of the basic  or even advanced principles prominently  he did serve as the grand master of the  shingen ryu school of kung fu  and this is the only known organization  in the series which teaches nen  as a formalized study and not only that  but netra also served as the essential  founder of the institution which to be  clear the shingen ryu school may have  existed prior to netro but it was he who  took it over  and incorporated the rigorous study of  nen into the program as such nataro was  often regarded by others as the most  powerful nen user in the world however  netro himself disputes this on multiple  occasions such as when he states the  following it's been more than half a  century since i was the most powerful  nene master you two and i are probably  evenly matched at this point the two  people netro was referring to in this  case being moral and nov which is how we  know for a fact that netro was at the  very least lying about this latter part  as he would go on to demonstrably  eclipse both moral and nov in every  aspect  of nen during the chimera antar and that  is something to very much bear in mind  netro is also exceptionally skilled at  hiding his true power  not one character in hunt hunter has  ever been able to accurately measure  nesro like for example during the hunter  exam kilauea severely underestimated him  and even as recently as the chimera  antar king maruem consistently thought  of netro as less of a threat than he was  which is an interesting phenomena that  seems to accompany students of the  shingen ryu school of kung fu for  example both biski and wing  also possess this ability to completely  shroud their potential and in a way it's  almost like a very advanced application  of zetsu  it doesn't really matter though because  whatever it is nataro's definitely got  it and with that said we now turn to  netro's net affinity which is another  debated topic because it's never  actually stated in the series however  naturo has  been identified as a natural enhancer in  two different hunt hunter data books and  the reason why we need to maintain a  healthy level of skepticism surrounding  this  is because the data books are  notoriously inaccurate with various  details mostly concerning names and  timelines the data books are also  highly highly unlikely to have been  written by togashi himself and that  always brings up the inevitable question  of canonici in this particular case i'm  going to dismiss that question outright  though because it has been published in  two different sources approved by  well the publisher and until stated  otherwise that's just what we have to  work with with that said netro does fit  in with the typical personification of  an enhancer  simple and determined with their words  and actions being dominated by their  feelings  although i do think an argument could be  made for him being a transmuter but  not in this video the reason why netro's  net affinity is important though is  because it informs the construction of  his crowning ability the 100 type  guanine bodhisattva and this is an  ability in which we see netro's  determination manifested allowing him to  either conjure or emit a golden deity  capable of striking enemies at  unfathomable speeds  and you could potentially call it an end  beast but actually acts more like a  puppet construct it doesn't have a life  of its own and it is entirely controlled  by netera and it functions as follows in  order to initiate an attack or movement  netero must first bring his hands  together as if in prayer and then signal  one of the 100 possible motions for the  hands to make so it's actually a very  very difficult puppet to make move  because the prayer motion has to be  repeated before  every new movement and not only that but  if netro moves too far from the statue's  range during combat then he also needs  to unsummon and then re-summon the  statue to a new spot and i would  actually go so far as to say that this  ability would be fairly useless for  anybody who is not isaac netaro because  it's quite clunky and inefficient  however for a man who is capable of  punching over 10  000 times in less than an hour this is  pretty brilliant in fact due to his  absurd speed netra can perform both the  prayer and the assigned hand action  together in less than 0.1 of a second  which not only gives the illusion that  the guanine statue was moving as if it  had a life of its own but it is actually  moving much faster than any human  possibly could  very much epitomizing and manifesting  the ultimate power of prayer based  punches  although quite interestingly this leads  to a bit of a contradiction of meaning  because to get all weird and into  textual for a second it's worth stating  that the generated statue of guanyin  appears to be crying and in the manga  there are even points where these tears  are shaded in a manner that resembles  the effect of blood and you could say  this is because guanine is actually  labeled as a goddess of mercy and  compassion you know two qualities that  netro really does  not possess which rather ironically his  primary opponent meroem did but  that's a whole other discussion however  this crying effect may very well be the  result of using the form of guanyin for  a directly violent purpose  and in general it's just very  interesting to see that this form is  what manifested from netero's drive and  desire his entire life has been  dedicated to the worship of violence  not so much in a gratuitous way but his  entire life's purpose basically boils  down to battling an unstoppable  adversary who would ideally  eventually kill him so i guess guanyin  is a symbol of the oxymoron of netro's  ideals the fact that he is really only  at peace when engaged in conflict and  not only that but incredibly stressful  and potentially life-threatening  conflict now in terms of all the fun  technicalities and such the only solid  affinity we can attribute to the 100  type guanine bodhisattva  is that of manipulation netaro is quite  clearly manipulating the statue to do  his bidding and that really is the core  of the ability which if netro were an  enhancer would speak volumes to his  sheer mastery of men  as manipulation would be a rather  unfriendly affinity to invest heavily  into i do have to say though in all  honesty i don't think netaro's net  affinity actually matters in the grand  scheme of things because no matter where  he lands on the nenring his skill and  aura quantity is so great that basic  affinity limitations are practically  meaningless once again adding to the  common theme of netro  as something of a transcendent being but  in terms of the statue itself this can  only be achieved via two mechanisms  either emission or conjuration or i  guess specialization if you wanted to  get semantic and i don't blame you if  you do because i  do that a lot but assuming natural is an  enhancer only emission or conjuration  and conjuration would be the natural  thought because the entire practice is  geared towards bringing physical  constructs into existence  however it is also possible to do this  viral mission as well it's not clear  exactly how but there are many many  examples of emitters creating nene  beasts and such like knuckle sakura or  razer's 14 devils  both of which are incredibly unlikely to  use conjuration due to it being their  least friendly affinity so that can't be  discounted from netro in fact as an  enhancer using a mission to create the  statue would make a lot more sense as it  would be easier to dip into but speaking  of it's not actually clear whether or  not netro uses enhancement in the 100  type coin in bodhisattvar at all the  only vague argument you could make is  that perhaps he uses aura to enhance the  statue thus making it much more powerful  and durable which i can potentially see  if he was an enhancer then it would make  a lot more sense to either conjure or  emit a basic statue and then use his  natural enhancement to make it  effectively indestructible and this is  because it would cost him a lot less  aura to do it that way rather than to  conjure or emit an already  indestructible statue this is all just  huge wild amounts of speculation though  so moving to another confirmed affinity  the 100 tab guanine bosatva does also  make use of clear transmutation and it  does so through the zero hand technique  a nice hidden 101st option of netera and  this is quite notable for being an  attack that does not necessarily require  the full prayer motion to be made as  natural was missing an arm at the time  he performed it in the series and in  this case the prayer comes purely from  the heart which results in the guanine  statue appearing behind an opponent  embracing them in its hand things  and then proceeding to fire every last  drop of netro's raw aura in their  general direction or actually i  shouldn't say  raw aura because it is being clearly  transmuted into another substance which  was described as being fired in a flare  like a dazzling star and it also almost  certainly makes use of a mission as well  in order to you know actually fire  whatever that transmuted substance is  regardless it is a pretty terrifying  attack that makes the ultimate use of  netro seemingly infinite or reserves  and against anyone who is not like some  sort of ant king then they would  immediately die without question  although very few others would have  pushed netro to the point of actually  using zerohand which is a surprisingly  big problem for netero actually his net  mastery did reach the point where there  was no human opponent really capable of  challenging him and for someone who had  dedicated their life to the pursuit of  martial arts and challenge this became  quite unsatisfying and i think points  like that speak to neta's power far more  than any actual demonstration could  because we know in great detail the kind  of maddeningly powerful people who exist  in hunt hunter you know the hisokas the  enemies the crawlers of the world in  fact you could even throw in the chimera  and royal guards as well and not one of  them is  in any way capable of standing up to  netera and we did see this in action  with nefapito actually  pito very briefly tried to engage with  netro before being promptly swatted away  in a single strike  unable to even catch sight of what had  hit them and this could either be  because netro was coating guanyin in a  layer of in or it could simply have been  that netro was just so  fast crafting and using the statue that  it was unable to be seen by peter each  of which are equally as possible but in  the end it doesn't really matter the  fact is that someone like pito is  already completely out of this world  when it comes to nen  and netro exists far above even that but  what do you guys  think please do leave your thoughts in  the comments below or even join my  discord server and if you're keen for  some more hunt on  content then please to go and check out  some of my other videos or even  subscribe to the channel for regular  hunt and glory delivered straight into  your youtube feed but for now this has  been the new world review  and i'll see you next time

